Vendored text
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Three prompts in packages/server/src/agent_media_server/tidy_patterns/fabric/
(fix_typos, improve_writing, create_formal_email) are copied, unchanged, from
Fabric (https://github.com/danielmiessler/Fabric, by Daniel Miessler), MIT
licence, at commit f16de16 (23 Oct 2026). The licence text, with the
copyright line the repository carries, is kept beside them in
tidy_patterns/fabric/LICENSE; tidy_patterns/README.md gives the source, the
pinned commit and how to update. Fabric is not run and is not a dependency:
only the prompt text is included.
